    {
      "id": "2123961754153517089",
      "text": "The Wizards had next-to-nil physicality on defense and minimal on-ball containment during that first half. They allowed only one free throw, and that was on a transition take foul by Trae Young. The Bulls made 56.5 percent of their shot attempts and lead 60-52 at halftime.",
