    },
    {
      "id": "2123249795292909695",
      "text": "The Wizards have escaped with a 103-99 victory over the Raptors, breaking their eight-game losing streak. AJ Dybantsa recorded his first double-double, with 23 points and 12 rebounds. Anthony Davis had game highs of 25 points and 14 rebounds.",
      "url": "https://x.com/JoshuaBRobbins/status/2123249795292909695",
      "published": "2026-11-19T02:59:33+00:00",
      "likes": 12,
      "author": "Josh Robbins",
      "handle": "JoshuaBRobbins",
      "avatar": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1358290326/Josh_Robbins_mugshot_normal.jpg",
      "media": "",
      "quoted_text": "",
      "quoted_author": "",
      "quoted_handle": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "2123248432215446000",
      "text": "That's a new season-high and career-high point total for AJ Dybantsa, who has 23 points.",
      "url": "https://x.com/JoshuaBRobbins/status/2123248432215446000",
      "published": "2026-11-19T02:54:08+00:00",
      "likes": 8,
      "author": "Josh Robbins",
      "handle": "JoshuaBRobbins",
      "avatar": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1358290326/Josh_Robbins_mugshot_normal.jpg",
      "media": "",
      "quoted_text": "",
      "quoted_author": "",
      "quoted_handle": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "2123242436029808836",
      "text": "AJ Dybantsa has his first NBA career double-double.",
      "url": "https://x.com/JoshuaBRobbins/status/2123242436029808836",
      "published": "2026-11-19T02:30:19+00:00",
      "likes": 25,
      "author": "Josh Robbins",
      "handle": "JoshuaBRobbins",
      "avatar": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1358290326/Josh_Robbins_mugshot_normal.jpg",
      "media": "",
      "quoted_text": "",
      "quoted_author": "",
      "quoted_handle": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "2123232064887812215",
      "text": "At halftime, AJ Dybantsa needs two more rebounds to record the first double-double of his NBA career.",
      "url": "https://x.com/JoshuaBRobbins/status/2123232064887812215",
      "published": "2026-11-19T01:49:06+00:00",
      "likes": 14,
      "author": "Josh Robbins",
      "handle": "JoshuaBRobbins",
      "avatar": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1358290326/Josh_Robbins_mugshot_normal.jpg",
      "media": "",
      "quoted_text": "",
      "quoted_author": "",
      "quoted_handle": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "2123227656296804836",
      "text": "If you have a DVR, I recommend you rewind back to 3:53 remaining in the second quarter. Anthony Davis just had one of the Wizards' best out-of-area defensive rebounds of the season.",
      "url": "https://x.com/JoshuaBRobbins/status/2123227656296804836",
      "published": "2026-11-19T01:31:35+00:00",
      "likes": 7,
      "author": "Josh Robbins",
      "handle": "JoshuaBRobbins",
      "avatar": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1358290326/Josh_Robbins_mugshot_normal.jpg",
      "media": "",
      "quoted_text": "",
      "quoted_author": "",
      "quoted_handle": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "2123227074924089660",
      "text": "One of the areas Kyshawn George improved over the offseason is with his no-dip 3-pointers from the corners. He just hit one to put Washington ahead 44-40.",
      "url": "https://x.com/JoshuaBRobbins/status/2123227074924089660",
      "published": "2026-11-19T01:29:16+00:00",
      "likes": 4,
      "author": "Josh Robbins",
      "handle": "JoshuaBRobbins",
      "avatar": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1358290326/Josh_Robbins_mugshot_normal.jpg",
      "media": "",
      "quoted_text": "",
      "quoted_author": "",
      "quoted_handle": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "2123225747988828363",
      "text": "The Wizards have to do a better job of getting Tre Johnson catch-and-shoot opportunities and to get him the ball when he moves off screens. Too often, he's trying to get his shots through ISOs and after taking several dribbles.",
      "url": "https://x.com/JoshuaBRobbins/status/2123225747988828363",
      "published": "2026-11-19T01:24:00+00:00",
      "likes": 100,
      "author": "Josh Robbins",
      "handle": "JoshuaBRobbins",
      "avatar": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1358290326/Josh_Robbins_mugshot_normal.jpg",
      "media": "",
      "quoted_text": "",
      "quoted_author": "",
      "quoted_handle": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "2123219913787441395",
      "text": "Early minutes tonight for Will Riley, who checks in with 5:03 remaining in the first quarter.",
      "url": "https://x.com/JoshuaBRobbins/status/2123219913787441395",
      "published": "2026-11-19T01:00:49+00:00",
